# [ src/dialogs/ZA02_sod_court_and_strategy/anyone_plyr_cpsq_0_07.py:L1-L5 ] anyone|plyr::cpsq_0->cpsq_liberator_1 [troop_slot_eq] {correct me if i'm mistaken, but you seem to have a close tie wit}
