# [ src/dialogs/ZA02_sod_court_and_strategy/anyone_plyr_cpsq_0_08.py:L1-L5 ] anyone|plyr::cpsq_0->cpsq_nihilistic_1 [troop_slot_eq] {despite your apparent lunacy, you seem to have some purpose behi}
