# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_01.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_01->legate_sq_1_02 [no_conditions] {no wonder. had i lost my influence, wealth and dignity in close }
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_01", [], "No wonder. Had I lost my influence, wealth and dignity in close succession just like them, I wouldn't talk too much about it either. In any case, the situation is quite differing from country to country.", "legate_sq_1_02", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_02->legate_sq_1_03 [no_conditions] {proceed in a-b-c sequence. start with the kingdom of aden.}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_02", [], "proceed in A-B-C sequence. Start with the Kingdom of Aden.", "legate_sq_1_03", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_03.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_03->legate_sq_1_04 [no_conditions] {the old kingdom of aden was always quite chaotic. all things con}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_03", [], "The old Kingdom of Aden was always quite chaotic. All things considered, it still is, though imperial rule has improved the conditions to some degree. You see, the Adenian Lords had more influence and military might than the king himself prior to the imperial invasion. After the royal family was overthrown, some Lords sided with us, while the loyalists were either killed, stripped of their titles or banished. ", "legate_sq_1_04", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_04.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_04->legate_sq_1_05 [no_conditions] {and then there were those who proclaimed neutrality and went on }
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_04", [], "And then there were those who proclaimed neutrality and went on nurturing their own little private domains and personal armies. Since these baronies are well-fortified and the war was still raging on back then, we soon forged peace treaties with these seperatists. Nowadays they continue to fight among themselves and make no combined effort to restore the former kingdom, thus they are of little concern to us. In due time, their loneliness will be the cause of their downfall. ", "legate_sq_1_05", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_05.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_05->legate_sq_1_06 [no_conditions] {as for the rest of the territories, they are either under the co}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_05", [], "As for the rest of the territories, they are either under the control of once-Adenian Lords or were gifted to certain Centurions who participated in the campaign. At first there were a couple of peasant rebellions, but by now things have settled down. Unless a royal heir returns and unites the former Lords anytime soon, the very memory of Aden will soon fade away.", "legate_sq_1_06", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_06.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_06->legate_sq_1_07 [no_conditions] {move on. what about the empire of antaria ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_06", [], "Move on. What about the Empire of Antaria ?", "legate_sq_1_07", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_07.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_07->legate_sq_1_08 [no_conditions] {a shadow of its former self, though i have to respect the persis}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_07", [], "A shadow of its former self, though I have to respect the persistance of the locals. Even after the mighty cities of Antares crumbled and imperial government was established, some elements of the former nobility organized a great uprising. It took a lot of time and effort to make order. ", "legate_sq_1_08", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_08.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_08->legate_sq_1_09 [no_conditions] {by now, almost every place in the former empire of antaria is un}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_08", [], "By now, almost every place in the former Empire of Antaria is under full control, though pockets of resistance still endure among the mountains of Jarnas and the Imperial Investigation Office claims that a single sparkle of hope to topple the imperial authorities would be enough to stir up the city-dwelling populace. ", "legate_sq_1_09", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_09.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_09->legate_sq_1_10 [no_conditions] {however, many people died in the war and the rebellions; the eco}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_09", [], "However, many people died in the war and the rebellions; the economy of Antaria would lie ruined if it wasn't for us. Undeniably, the Antarians are hard to regulate, but mark my words: given enough time, their fighting spirit will either vanish or join with ours. You studied history, {playername}; you know that I'm correct.", "legate_sq_1_10", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_10.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_10->legate_sq_1_11 [no_conditions] {what of the republic of marina ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_10", [], "What of the Republic of Marina ?", "legate_sq_1_11", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_11.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_11->legate_sq_1_12 [no_conditions] {we established a single-party puppet government composed of nobl}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_11", [], "We established a single-party puppet government composed of nobles and wealthy merchants who were actually our secret supporters during the course of the war. Not as if our empire hadn't had informers and bootlickers in each and every other country, but letting such money-craving sweepings of society worm themselves this high disgusts even me.", "legate_sq_1_12", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_12.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_12->legate_sq_1_13 [no_conditions] {no wonder the local populace is growing ever more furious, espec}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_12", [], "No wonder the local populace is growing ever more furious, especially in the larger cities. High taxes, censorship, secret police, public executions on the streets - I think you get the point. It's almost as bad as the old Zerrikanian Sultanate and that's saying something.", "legate_sq_1_13", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_13.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_13->legate_sq_1_14 [no_conditions] {but don't worry. it's all part of the plan. when the situation t}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_13", [], "But don't worry. It's all part of the plan. When the situation turns really grim, we'll simply march in and set things right. And then, all Marinans will be proud imperial citizens.", "legate_sq_1_14", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_14.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_14->legate_sq_1_15 [no_conditions] {hmpf. and the villianese duchy ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_14", [], "Hmpf. And the Villianese Duchy ?", "legate_sq_1_15", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_15.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_15->legate_sq_1_16 [no_conditions] {we've accomplished what no duke of villian ever could - unified }
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_15", [], "We've accomplished what no Duke of Villian ever could - unified the populace. The old clan system is no more; the chiefs were stripped of all political power. Well, at least most of them.", "legate_sq_1_16", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_16.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_16->legate_sq_1_17 [no_conditions] {some clans are still hiding among the dense forestlands and hill}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_16", [], "Some clans are still hiding among the dense forestlands and hills of the old Duchy and continue to harass others with raid attacks from time to time. Their days are numbered, however. The majority of the populace generally tolerates the new government. ", "legate_sq_1_17", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_17.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_17->legate_sq_1_18 [no_conditions] {with each passing day, imperial rule strengthens; but the rebels}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_17", [], "With each passing day, imperial rule strengthens; but the rebels do not. Without outside help, they will either need to submit to us or die of starvation. Relatively soon - a few years maybe ? - all of the old Villianese Duchy will be a well-built imperial province.", "legate_sq_1_18", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_18.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_18->legate_sq_1_19 [no_conditions] {what are things like in zerrikania ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_18", [], "What are things like in Zerrikania ?", "legate_sq_1_19", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_19.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_19->legate_sq_1_20 [no_conditions] {a complete disaster, from every possible point of view. after th}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_19", [], "A complete disaster, from every possible point of view. After the Sultanate was defeated in the war, the Imperial Legion helped a powerful Boyar to the throne. He helped us during the war by organizing assassinations against loyalist Boyars and their sons. However, he turned out to be a terribly bad monarch, so to speak.", "legate_sq_1_20", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_20.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_20->legate_sq_1_21 [no_conditions] {the zerrikanian sultanate is in dire need of reforms. the previo}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_20", [], "The Zerrikanian Sultanate is in dire need of reforms. The previous Sultan understood this, but these reforms include granting more rights to the lower classes, including the peasantry and the slaves, something which certain elements of the Zerrikan nobility and clergy find outrageous, including the current Sultan himself. And so the peasants and slaves are still nothing but property of the higher classes.", "legate_sq_1_21", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_21.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_21->legate_sq_1_22 [no_conditions] {peasant revolts and slave rebellions are frequent, especially in}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_21", [], "Peasant revolts and slave rebellions are frequent, especially in densely populated towns, but are usually small in size. Zerrikania, as it is, is a living hell. But all that is necessary. Once this campaign in Calradia is finished, we'll overthrow all the remnants of the decadent Zerrikan nobility and establish a proper imperial governorship. We will be hailed as savior and liberators.", "legate_sq_1_22", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_22.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_22->legate_sq_1_23 [no_conditions] {saviors and liberators ? i'd like to see how you pull that off.}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_22", [], "Saviors and liberators ? I'd like to see how you pull THAT off.", "legate_sq_1_23", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_23.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_23->legate_sq_1_24 [no_conditions] {it's easier than you'd dare to imagine, {var}. nations as a whol}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_23", [], "It's easier than you'd dare to imagine, {playername}. Nations as a whole can have dreadfully short memories at times. They remember how they were invaded by us, yes. But are we cruel to them in Antaria, Villian or Aden ? No. In certain ways, we are a lot more humanitarian than their so-called \"righful overlords\". And Marina or Zerrikania ? We pulled the troops out and gave power in the hands of would-be tyrants.", "legate_sq_1_24", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_24.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_24->legate_sq_1_25 [no_conditions] {it is not us who tax them so heavily; it is not us who make them}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_24", [], "It is not us who tax them so heavily; it is not us who make them work to death; it is not us who restrict their religions. Just wait and observe, {playername}. A decade, perhaps two, and nobody will give a damn anymore about an invasion by the Imperial Legion that occured such a \"long\" time ago when they have a lot of other trouble to put up with, imposed on them by their own rulers. ", "legate_sq_1_25", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_25.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_25->legate_sq_1_26 [no_conditions] {and nobody will remember nor care either about \"who\" helped th}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_25", [], "And nobody will remember nor care either about \"who\" helped these despots to their position of power. Imagine then, the Imperial Legion marching in and making order, establishing peace and laying down the foundations of a better life for the locals. You think it's unlikely ? Ask yourself then, would you not cheer for someone who freed you from decades of tyranny and poverty ?", "legate_sq_1_26", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_26.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_26->legate_sq_1_27 [no_conditions] {disgusting but effectice. and you had that all planned out from }
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_26", [], "Disgusting but effectice. And you had that all planned out from the beginning ?", "legate_sq_1_27", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_27.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_27->legate_sq_1_28 [no_conditions] {our empire has quite some experience at political scheming, my y}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_27", [], "Our empire has quite some experience at political scheming, my young friend. And let me tell you that there is no greater threat towards a culture than peaceful assimilation. If reforms and changes are carried out slowly and are enforced only by local conditions, no-one resists. Given enough time, every one of your own kinsmen will give up the elements of culture that made them what they were. ", "legate_sq_1_28", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_28.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_28->legate_sq_1_29 [no_conditions] {their language, building style, arts, social order, their entire}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_28", [], "Their language, building style, arts, social order, their entire way of thinking will be replaced or augmented by ours. {playername}, there are very, very few nationalities which died out because of genocide. But the number of assimilated ones is beyond counting. ", "legate_sq_1_29", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_29.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_29->legate_sq_1_30 [no_conditions] {this is how even the proudest nations can be erased from history}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_29", [], "This is how even the proudest nations can be erased from history - not by senseless, barbaric slaughter, but by making their mother language richer with foreign words; by willingly embracing foreign literature and religion; by kisses from a foreign lover. Of course, in such a relation, both sides earn something beneficial. The assimilated earns better living standards; while the assimilator gains an ally to call upon.", "legate_sq_1_30", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_30.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_30->legate_sq_1_31 [no_conditions] {i won't let the {var} end like this. once i'm done here, i'll li}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_30", [], "I won't let the {s31} end like this. Once I'm done here, I'll liberate my home.", "legate_sq_1_31", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_31.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_31->cpsq_0 [eq] {if you survive. if you triumph. if you get home. if you can libe}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_31", [(eq, "$centurion_first_meeting", 1)], "IF you survive. IF you triumph. IF you get home. IF you can liberate it. Time is against you, {playername}; I'm afraid there's little chance you'll ever be able to fulfill such a promise.", "cpsq_0", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_1_31_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_1_31->party_encounter_hostile_defender [no_conditions] {if you survive. if you triumph. if you get home. if you can libe}
[anyone, "legate_sq_1_31", [], "IF you survive. IF you triumph. IF you get home. IF you can liberate it. Time is against you, {playername}; I'm afraid there's little chance you'll ever be able to fulfill such a promise.", "party_encounter_hostile_defender", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_01.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_01->legate_sq_2_02 [no_conditions] {knowing your enemy is vital to victory, isn't it ? though consid}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_01", [], "Knowing your enemy is vital to victory, isn't it ? Though considering your condition in this war... very well, I shall gift you with this knowledge. I was born in Casius province of the empire, as first and only son of Lucian Marius, the previous Legate. My mother was an elegant woman from one of the noble houses of Aden, or so I've been told - I never knew her, since she died during my birth. ", "legate_sq_2_02", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_02->legate_sq_2_03 [no_conditions] {i spent my youth learning by my father's side just about everyth}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_02", [], "I spent my youth learning by my father's side just about everything: arts, literature, languages, oratory, diplomacy, and, of course, warfare. My father said a Legate has to be mighty in many fields. Eventually, he retired and I took his place. The rest you know.", "legate_sq_2_03", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_03.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_03->legate_sq_2_04 [no_conditions] {through decades, our empire has been preparing for a massive con}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_03", [], "Through decades, our empire has been preparing for a massive conquest, to which your own homeland also fell. Now we're doing the same here, in Calradia. But know this, {playername}: what I do, I do without hate. The emperor gives an order, and I fulfill it.", "legate_sq_2_04", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_2_04.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_2_04->legate_sq_2_05 [no_conditions] {and you're satisfied by being a tool towards a sick end like wor}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_2_04", [], "And you're satisfied by being a tool towards a sick end like world dominance ?", "legate_sq_2_05", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_05.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_05->legate_sq_2_06 [no_conditions] {do not talk as if you had the right to judge me. where would thi}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_05", [], "Do not talk as if you had the right to judge me. Where would this world sink if ordinary people began questioning the authority of their superiors ?", "legate_sq_2_06", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_06.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_06->legate_sq_2_07 [no_conditions] {you wouldn't be too joyful either if one of your lords turned up}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_06", [], "You wouldn't be too joyful either if one of your Lords turned upon you because he doesn't think that you rule justly enough, would you now ?", "legate_sq_2_07", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_2_07.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_2_07->legate_sq_2_08 [no_conditions] {that is something i can't argue with. still, your methods of war}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_2_07", [], "That is something I can't argue with. Still, your methods of war are cruel.", "legate_sq_2_08", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_08.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_08->legate_sq_2_09 [no_conditions] {my young friend, war in itself is cruel, regardless of why it is}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_08", [], "My young friend, war in itself is cruel, regardless of why it is fought for. It is the homes of the humble people that are burnt; it is their crops that are destroyed by marching soldiers; it is their sons and fathers who die in the field of carnage, leaving behind orphans, widows and mourning mothers.", "legate_sq_2_09", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_09.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_09->legate_sq_2_10 [no_conditions] {listen to me, {var}: the aim of war is always power; whether to }
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_09", [], "Listen to me, {playername}: the aim of war is always power; whether to liberate or enslave, you need power. And never forget: all power demands sacrifice. Yes, I have contributed to the conquest of five nations, including yours. But ask yourself:", "legate_sq_2_10", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_10.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_10->legate_sq_2_11 [no_conditions] {what did it take for you to claim a kingdom on your own ? how ma}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_10", [], "what did it take for you to claim a kingdom on your own ? How many corpses pave the roads you walked upon ? Hundreds ? Thousands ? The native countries of Calradia are in chaos and disarray, thanks to you. How many villages, castles and towns have been ravaged and burnt in your wake ?", "legate_sq_2_11", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_2_11.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_2_11->legate_sq_2_12 [no_conditions] {fewer than in yours, though i see your point.}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_2_11", [], "Fewer than in yours, though I see your point.", "legate_sq_2_12", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_12.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_12->legate_sq_2_13 [no_conditions] {i'm glad to hear that.}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_12", [], "I'm glad to hear that.", "legate_sq_2_13", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_2_13.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_2_13->legate_sq_2_14 [no_conditions] {still, you don't seem satisfied with your work. why do you serve}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_2_13", [], "Still, you don't seem satisfied with your work. Why do you serve the emperor then ?", "legate_sq_2_14", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_14.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_14->legate_sq_2_15 [no_conditions] {just like you were raised to rule, i was raised to serve. nothin}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_14", [], "Just like you were raised to rule, I was raised to serve. Nothing more, nothing less. Though I will never forget the horrible deeds I had to do, still I must carry on. Not necessarily for the empire or the emperor, but if for nothing else, my soldiers and every people who dwell these lands.", "legate_sq_2_15", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_15.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_15->legate_sq_2_16 [no_conditions] {the sooner this war comes to an end, the less time it will take }
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_15", [], "The sooner this war comes to an end, the less time it will take to heal the scars of conflict, and start a new, more peaceful era. To see this vision come true is my responsibility as a leader of the Imperial Legion.", "legate_sq_2_16", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_1_16.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_1_16->legate_sq_2_17 [no_conditions] {hm. though we are on opposing sides, i have to admire your deter}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_1_16", [], "Hm. Though we are on opposing sides, I have to admire your determination.", "legate_sq_2_17", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_17.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_17->cpsq_0 [eq] {so do i admire yours, {var}. see, we are not as different as you}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_17", [(eq, "$centurion_first_meeting", 1)], "So do I admire yours, {playername}. See, we are not as different as you may think.", "cpsq_0", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_2_17_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_2_17->party_encounter_hostile_defender [no_conditions] {so do i admire yours, {var}. see, we are not as different as you}
[anyone, "legate_sq_2_17", [], "So do I admire yours, {playername}. See, we are not as different as you may think.", "party_encounter_hostile_defender", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_01.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_01->legate_sq_3_02 [no_conditions] {the purpose of war is power, and all power demands sacrifice. th}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_01", [], "The purpose of war is power, and all power demands sacrifice. The only question is: to what end. Each and every emperor of our empire had their own reasons. ", "legate_sq_3_02", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_02->legate_sq_3_03 [no_conditions] {the current emperor, janus constantinus, is somewhat different f}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_02", [], "The current emperor, Janus Constantinus, is somewhat different from them, however; he has a vision of a world that is free from the curse of Time.", "legate_sq_3_03", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_3_03.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_3_03->legate_sq_3_04 [no_conditions] {curse of time ? what nonsense is that ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_3_03", [], "Curse of Time ? What nonsense is that ?", "legate_sq_3_04", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_04.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_04->legate_sq_3_05 [no_conditions] {a nonsense that can ruin individuals and nations alike. time is }
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_04", [], "A nonsense that can ruin individuals and nations alike. Time is always in motion, {playername}. Nothing is eternal; in due time, even mountains of solid rock begin to abrade and crumble. One day, this entire world will come crashing down to the abyss.", "legate_sq_3_05", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_05.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_05->legate_sq_3_06 [no_conditions] {will it end with a great bang ? or will we make ourselves extinc}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_05", [], "Will it end with a great bang ? Or will we make ourselves extinct before it ? Or shall the human race continue to exist, slowly drowning the world by its inbred corruption and lust for dominance, until apocalypse will be something to actually long after ? I believe none of these horrors are desirable.", "legate_sq_3_06", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_3_06.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_3_06->legate_sq_3_07 [no_conditions] {these are disturbing visions indeed, but what do they have to do}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_3_06", [], "These are disturbing visions indeed, but what do they have to do with the present ?", "legate_sq_3_07", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_07.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_07->legate_sq_3_08 [no_conditions] {if you rule the present, you overcome the past and control the f}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_07", [], "If you rule the present, you overcome the past and control the future. You may call my emperor a madman if you wish, but all this fighting, as gruesome it may be, serves the whole of mankind. As long as empires, nations, countries, communities, families and individuals continue to struggle among themselves, mankind will not develop, or at best rather slowly.", "legate_sq_3_08", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_08.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_08->legate_sq_3_09 [no_conditions] {all those resources, all those lives wasted in battle... think o}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_08", [], "All those resources, all those lives wasted in battle... think of what we could accomplish with them if they weren't spent on pointless infighting ! So why not unite the kingdoms of the world ? Why not become a family of nations, all part of one great empire ? ", "legate_sq_3_09", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_09.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_09->legate_sq_3_10 [no_conditions] {even the major religions, including {var} preach of the equality}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_09", [], "Even the major religions, including {s33} preach of the equality of human beings. This only further supports the idea of a unified world envisioned by my emperor.", "legate_sq_3_10", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_3_10.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_3_10->legate_sq_3_11 [no_conditions] {interesting thoughts, but i don't think they would prevent the w}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_3_10", [], "Interesting thoughts, but I don't think they would prevent the world's end when it's due.", "legate_sq_3_11", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_11.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_11->legate_sq_3_12 [no_conditions] {i consider it worth a try. have you read of the great calradian }
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_11", [], "I consider it worth a try. Have you read of the Great Calradian Empire ? Before that, this whole continent was filled with primitive, uncivilised barbaric tribes. Under the rule of the Great Calradian Empire, these tribes became the advanced, mighty kingdoms of Calradia we know today. ", "legate_sq_3_12", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_12.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_12->legate_sq_3_13 [no_conditions] {the only problem was that they each developed a strong sense of }
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_12", [], "The only problem was that they each developed a strong sense of nationalism in the process, thus causing the empire to fall apart. But the technological and ideological developments survive to this very day. ", "legate_sq_3_13", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_13.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_13->legate_sq_3_14 [no_conditions] {you see, improvements and new discoveries occur more frequently }
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_13", [], "You see, improvements and new discoveries occur more frequently during times of peaceful cooperation where no infighting is present and debates are constructive arguments rather than battles of thoughts.", "legate_sq_3_14", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_3_14.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_3_14->legate_sq_3_15 [no_conditions] {i agree to some degree. but then again, what's the point ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_3_14", [], "I agree to some degree. But then again, what's the point ?", "legate_sq_3_15", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_15.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_15->legate_sq_3_16 [no_conditions] {the faceless, easily manipulated masses will never be fully suit}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_15", [], "The faceless, easily manipulated masses will never be fully suited to decide their own fate, {playername}. Thus, in long terms they would only shamble to their doom when resources become scarce - or so does my emperor say. As such, it is the responsibility of monarchs like him and you to guide their respective people on the road to the future.", "legate_sq_3_16", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_16.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_16->legate_sq_3_17 [no_conditions] {now then, if we all unite and technology develops fast, who know}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_16", [], "Now then, if we all unite and technology develops fast, who knows what will become possible ? Will we find the secret of long life ? Will we discover worlds beyond our own ? Will we be able to travel there and inhabit them ? There's a chance to all of these. And, if that is so, then humanity will thrive, prosper and improve in nature, able to withstand the curse of Time.", "legate_sq_3_17", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_17.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_17->legate_sq_3_18 [no_conditions] {i know, upon first hearing these may sound like the ravings of a}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_17", [], "I know, upon first hearing these may sound like the ravings of a madman; and indeed, many of the Imperial Legion question the sanity of our emperor. But giving it some thought, I myself found the genius behind the mask of lunacy. I may not live to see the fate of our empire unfold, but still, I consider these visions of the future worth fighting for.", "legate_sq_3_18", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_3_18.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_3_18->legate_sq_3_19 [no_conditions] {these ideas are hard to comprehend. i respect your goal, but the}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_3_18", [], "These ideas are hard to comprehend. I respect your goal, but the war between us will continue.", "legate_sq_3_19", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_19.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_19->cpsq_0 [eq] {i can't blame you for your choice, {var}. i'd probably act the s}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_19", [(eq, "$centurion_first_meeting", 1)], "I can't blame you for your choice, {playername}. I'd probably act the same way as you. But at least I could express the reasons behind my actions to someone.", "cpsq_0", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_3_19_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_3_19->party_encounter_hostile_defender [no_conditions] {i can't blame you for your choice, {var}. i'd probably act the s}
[anyone, "legate_sq_3_19", [], "I can't blame you for your choice, {playername}. I'd probably act the same way as you. But at least I could express the reasons behind my actions to someone.", "party_encounter_hostile_defender", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_01.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_01->legate_sq_4_02 [no_conditions] {i always knew you were a clever child, {var}. indeed, we could h}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_01", [], "I always knew you were a clever child, {playername}. Indeed, we could have killed you back in your homeland if we wanted to - with so many spies, informers and assassins at our disposal, it would had been quite simple to get rid of you and thus avoid your succession to the throne and a potential renewal of the fighting spirit of your people. ", "legate_sq_4_02", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_02->legate_sq_4_03 [no_conditions] {however, i knew you personally. i knew of your upbringing, your }
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_02", [], "However, I knew you personally. I knew of your upbringing, your education, your potential. It would had been a great waste.", "legate_sq_4_03", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_4_03.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_4_03->legate_sq_4_04 [no_conditions] {wait a second... how do you mean you knew me personally ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_4_03", [], "Wait a second... how do you mean you knew me personally ?", "legate_sq_4_04", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_04.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_04->legate_sq_4_05 [no_conditions] {when i was younger, i was working as a diplomat at a time to lea}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_04", [], "When I was younger, I was working as a diplomat at a time to learn of the politics of your home country. As such, I often met with your late parents. To establish a mutual trust of each other, we started off by sharing details of our family lives. Sometimes I even met you in person.", "legate_sq_4_05", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_05.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_05->legate_sq_4_06 [no_conditions] {don't blame yourself if you don't recall me, though; i used to b}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_05", [], "Don't blame yourself if you don't recall me, though; I used to be more handsome back then, with no scars dotting my body, not to mention I introduced myself with a fake name. Also, one of the advisors of your family was an agent of ours; quite expensive to afford, but to gather intelligence, it was worth it.", "legate_sq_4_06", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_4_06.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_4_06->legate_sq_4_07 [no_conditions] {honorless filth ! backstabbing my family like this ! and here i }
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_4_06", [], "Honorless filth ! Backstabbing my family like this ! And here I was starting to respect you !", "legate_sq_4_07", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_07.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_07->legate_sq_4_08 [no_conditions] {the \"accidents\" which caused the death of several of your rela}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_07", [], "The \"accidents\" which caused the death of several of your relatives were not planned nor supported by me, {playername}. In fact, it was me who prevented the assassination of your parents - and YOURS.", "legate_sq_4_08", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_4_08.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_4_08->legate_sq_4_09 [no_conditions] {let's pretend i believe this. but what purpose did that serve ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_4_08", [], "Let's pretend I believe this. But what purpose did that serve ?", "legate_sq_4_09", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_09.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_09->legate_sq_4_10 [no_conditions] {true, letting your parents live had lenghtened the war, but it b}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_09", [], "True, letting your parents live had lenghtened the war, but it bought me enough time to devise a simple, yet devious plan. As I said, I knew of your potential; your studies, your participation in duels and tournaments, and especially your contribution to the military resistance of your country all spoke loud of your abilities... and your hidden hunger for power.", "legate_sq_4_10", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_10.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_10->legate_sq_4_11 [no_conditions] {there were two options left to me: either to destroy you, or to }
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_10", [], "There were two options left to me: either to destroy you, or to make use of you to our benefit.", "legate_sq_4_11", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_4_11.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_4_11->legate_sq_4_12 [no_conditions] {you choose the latter. but how did it benefit you ?}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_4_11", [], "You choose the latter. But how did it benefit you ?", "legate_sq_4_12", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_12.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_12->legate_sq_4_13 [no_conditions] {our empire had records of the existance and location of calradia}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_12", [], "Our empire had records of the existance and location of Calradia. Some of the Zerrikanian and Marinan sea-sailing traders also knew these informations. I shared them with the advisor of your parents, and thus proposed an opportunity for you to escape and start anew. ", "legate_sq_4_13", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_13.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_13->legate_sq_4_14 [no_conditions] {i knew your parents would worry of you and thus heed this opport}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_13", [], "I knew your parents would worry of you and thus heed this opportunity to save you. It was a tight race against time though, as the Imperial Legion was already marching towards your capitol city by then.", "legate_sq_4_14", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_4_14.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_4_14->legate_sq_4_15 [no_conditions] {yes, i remember the excitement of those few days all to well. an}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_4_14", [], "Yes, I remember the excitement of those few days all to well. And then...?", "legate_sq_4_15", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_15.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_15->legate_sq_4_16 [no_conditions] {your survival was ensured, and i only had to wait for the result}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_15", [], "Your survival was ensured, and I only had to wait for the results. If you were to die in Calradia, it would had mattered little to us. But you survived - and raised a mighty army, and with it you made the kingdoms of Calradia crumble, and you even established your own kingdom in the process. ", "legate_sq_4_16", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_16.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_16->legate_sq_4_17 [no_conditions] {the cost ? untold number of lives, ruined countrysides and weake}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_16", [], "The cost ? Untold number of lives, ruined countrysides and weakened strongholds. A golden opportunity for the Imperial Legion to invade and simply sweep away everything in its path. {playername}, never forget: all power demands sacrifice... thank you for yours.", "legate_sq_4_17", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_4_17.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_4_17->legate_sq_4_18 [no_conditions] {gaius... your scheming makes me sick.}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_4_17", [], "Gaius... Your scheming makes me sick.", "legate_sq_4_18", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_18.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_18->legate_sq_4_19 [no_conditions] {it doesn't make me feel good either. but all for the sake of the}
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_18", [], "It doesn't make me feel good either. But all for the sake of the empire. Besides, would you feel better laying in a grave yourself ? I gave you a chance, and it was, and still is, up to you how you use it.", "legate_sq_4_19", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_legate_sq_4_19.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::legate_sq_4_19->legate_sq_4_20 [no_conditions] {you are a complex figure, gaius. however, when the time comes, y}
[anyone|plyr, "legate_sq_4_19", [], "You are a complex figure, Gaius. However, when the time comes, you'll regret letting me live.", "legate_sq_4_20", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_20.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_20->cpsq_0 [eq] {we shall see. do what you must, and i do what i must. when it's }
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_20", [(eq, "$centurion_first_meeting", 1)], "We shall see. Do what you must, and I do what I must. When it's due, the gods will decide who to favor.", "cpsq_0", [] ],
# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_legate_sq_4_20_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone::legate_sq_4_20->party_encounter_hostile_defender [no_conditions] {we shall see. do what you must, and i do what i must. when it's }
[anyone, "legate_sq_4_20", [], "We shall see. Do what you must, and I do what I must. When it's due, the gods will decide who to favor.", "party_encounter_hostile_defender", [] ],
