# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_plyr_party_encounter_hostile_defender_08.py:L1-L5 ] anyone|plyr::party_encounter_hostile_defender->cpsq_nihilistic_1 [troop_slot_eq] {despite your apparent lunacy, you seem to have some purpose behi}
