# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_loa_reaction_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::loa_reaction->loa_reaction_neg [no_conditions] {bah! you come to me now?! after all that has happened?!}
