# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_gm_talk_sell_prisoners.py:L1-L11 ] anyone::gm_talk_sell_prisoners->gm_talk_sell_prisoners_2 [this_or_next|eq|eq] {let me see what you have. live stock, troublemakers, deserters -}
