# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_gm_pact1_02.py:L1-L12 ] anyone::gm_pact1->gm_pretalk [assign|try_for_range|eq] {i have heard that you didn't pay one of the guilds for they work}
