# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_gm_mission_told_raid_caravan_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::gm_mission_told_raid_caravan->gm_mission_rejected [no_conditions] {i am not a cutthroat, find someone else.}
