# [ src/dialogs/ZB01_lords_politics_and_family/anyone_plyr_lord_meet_enemy_02.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::lord_meet_enemy->lord_intro [no_conditions] {they know me as {var}. mark it down, you shall be hearing of me }
