# [ src/dialogs/ZA01_startup_and_dispatch/anyone_auto_proceed_lord_request_mission_ask.py:L1-L28 ] anyone|auto_proceed::lord_request_mission_ask->lord_propose_mercenary [eq|ge|ge] {warning: this line should never display.}
