# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_siege_won_seneschal_list_options_3.py:L1-L6 ] anyone::siege_won_seneschal_list_options_3->siege_won_seneschal_list_options_4 [no_conditions] {of course you don't, my {var}. however, no lord in the land will}
[anyone, "siege_won_seneschal_list_options_3", [], "Of course you don't, my {lord/lady}.\
 However, no lord in the land will recognize your claim to the castle unless it is verified by royal decree.\
 They would call {s1} an outlaw stronghold and take it from you at the earliest opportunity.\
 Surely not even you could stand against a whole army.", "siege_won_seneschal_list_options_4", []],
# [ src/dialogs/ZD01_encounters_battles_and_prisoners/anyone_plyr_siege_won_seneschal_list_options_4.py:L1-L3 ] anyone|plyr::siege_won_seneschal_list_options_4->siege_won_seneschal_6 [no_conditions] {hmm. i'll give it some thought.}
