# [ src/dialogs/ZZ99_misc_dialogs/anyone_plyr_boar_clan_talk_03.py:L1-L10 ] anyone|plyr::boar_clan_talk->boar_clan_barter [eq|store_troop_gold|gt] {fine, i'll pay.}
